cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.idea/

# Regenerated results. Tables and summaries are rebuilt by any run and are
# large, so they stay out of the history; figures are committed, because they
# are what the manuscript carries and what a reader without the data can look
# at. Each format lives in its own directory, figures/png and figures/pdf, and
# both pass: what is excluded here is matched by extension, so a new kind of
# table is kept out without touching this file, while a new kind of figure is
# not silently lost.
#
# NOTE: a rule in the repository root wins over this file. If paper_results is
# excluded there, nothing below can bring the figures back.
paper_results/**/*.csv
paper_results/**/*.txt
paper_results/**/*.parquet
paper_results/**/*.npy
paper_results/**/*.xlsx